OL,3,GNEWSACat rescue fights to stay afloat
OL,4,Aas donations fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey charity has said the budget
OL,7,Fhas "offered little relief" as the
OL,8,Fvolunteer-run organisation continues to
OL,9,Ffight to stay afloat.
OL,11,FByfleet Cat Rescue said with income tax
OL,12,Fthresholds remaining frozen and the
OL,13,Fcost of living pressure continuing to
OL,14,Fmount, it was "worried for its future".
OL,16,F"We know everyone is struggling, but
OL,17,Fsadly, that also means more cats being
OL,18,Fsurrendered and fewer people able to
OL,19,Fdonate," a spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
